# What the image builds do NOT need.
#
# The build context is the repository root (see infra/*.Dockerfile), and it is
# otherwise ~25 MB of committed icons plus whatever is lying around locally.
# Everything here either rebuilds inside the image or has no business in one.

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
out
**/out
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo
*.local

# Machine-specific and gitignored, but a stale local copy would still be sent.
parser/
private/
shot*.png

# Never ship secrets into a layer.
infra/.env
**/.env

# The tracker is not part of any image. Its manifest stays, because pnpm needs
# every workspace package.json present to honour --frozen-lockfile: without it
# the lockfile reads as out of date and the install fails.
apps/tracker/**
!apps/tracker/package.json
